{"id":595,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"越境する学びでリーダーを育てる教育","feature_description":"追手門大手前は、教科・年齢・言語・文化の枠を越える学びを通じて、未来をつくるリーダーを育てます。一人ひとりに合った学びと教科横断の課題解決、本物に触れる経験を組み合わせ、探究力、共感力、自ら学び続ける力を養います。面談や自学自習への支援も重視し、学習の過程を自分で振り返ります。多様な人と協働して考え、社会に向けて行動する力を伸ばす学校です。","clubs":[{"id":11306,"name":"チアダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11307,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11308,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11309,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11310,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11311,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11312,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11313,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11314,"name":"ロボットサイエンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11315,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11316,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11317,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11318,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.otemon-js.ed.jp/hs/lif